<title>USA: Apria Healthcare hires Goldman Sachs.</title>
<headline>Apria Healthcare hires Goldman Sachs.</headline>
<dateline>COSTA MESA, Calif. 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Apria Healthcare Group Inc said Thursday  it has retained Goldman, Sachs &amp; Co. as its financial advisor and is considering a variety of potential alternatives, including a merger or sale of the company or a capital restructuring.</p>
</text>
